	(text "Notes\n- Buck instead of LDO: from 5 V an LDO would burn about 0.6 W and warm the sensors.\n- USB D+/D- are a 90 ohm pair (0.25 mm / 0.15 mm gap): keep short, ESD diode U2 right at J1.\n- CC1/CC2 5.1k to GND: the host offers 5 V. VBUS_IN is before the polyfuse, VBUS after it.\n- Layout: buck bottom centre, far from the BME688; input cap C1 at VIN, output caps at L1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "71e7aef7-766c-59f6-b950-aee74241c5e6"))
